{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35626","headline":"贺邢州卢员外 · 李山甫","name":"贺邢州卢员外","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"紫泥飞诏下金銮，列象分明世仰观。\n北省谏书藏旧草，南宫郎署握新兰。\n春归凤沼恩波暖，晓入鸳行瑞气寒。\n偏是此生栖息者，满衣零泪一时乾。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李山甫","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35626.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35626","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}